      "severity": "high",
      "checkedBy": "ai",
      "citation": "FD&C Act §201(g)(1); 21 CFR 101.93(g)",
      "aiGuidance": "Wording that says or implies the product treats, cures, mitigates, manages or prevents a disease or health condition (for example diabetes, high blood pressure, heart disease, cancer, arthritis, depression). Foods and supplements that make these claims are regulated as drugs."
